exit 0
--- stdout
deedglass policy · Write, test and activate policies

Usage  deedglass policy <command> [flags]

  lint          Check a policy file
  fmt           Format a policy file
  test          Run a policy's test cases
  push          Upload a new policy version
  activate      Activate a policy version
  evaluate      Evaluate one action against a policy
  replay        Replay past actions against a version
  diff          Compare two policy versions
  install       Install a policy pack as files
  packs list    List the policy packs
  packs verify  Check the packs against their signed index
